Zero point energy                ...      0.10620120 Eh      66.64 kcal/mol
Thermal vibrational correction   ...      0.00290241 Eh       1.82 kcal/mol
Thermal rotational correction    ...      0.00141627 Eh       0.89 kcal/mol
